<p>This transfer and location suit business travellers who need a central, easily reached base with straightforward airport access, as well as design-conscious travellers and couples who appreciate the contrast between the building's historic shell and modern interior. Given the formal, civic character of the building and its central position, it's a natural fit for guests combining a stay with meetings or corporate events elsewhere in the Eixample, while remaining within walking distance of Gaudí's landmark buildings for any free time between commitments.</p>
